    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/ce65bea17bd202c7eb44ff80e3d77ee4.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling team-based roguelike game where strategy is key! Assemble your squad, prepare for intense battles, and unleash powerful combos to outsmart your foes. Each encounter challenges your tactics and adaptability, ensuring no two runs are ever the same. Gear up, strategize, and fight for survival in an ever-changing world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/ffc381f3b79a7f7dfaf8d8d473565727.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate party of four from a diverse cast of characters! Choose agile archers, powerful magicians, valiant swordsmen, and resourceful miners, each with unique abilities. Mix and match to discover powerful synergies and conquer every challenge. The adventure awaits\u2014who will join your quest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/179966dcc6eaa8a773321082eb4c5e57.avif?t=1745413899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/b3cf4dcf54b4ef8c41fc5ce2880dfece.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast array of maps filled with hidden treasures and formidable foes. Each area offers unique challenges and secrets waiting to be conquered. Venture deep into the unknown and uncover the mysteries that lie within the abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/249ab1f80f58ae25713476cbeaa222f0.avif?t=1745413899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/e70d5c83a5cac6e4a4dc9cf3e1cbbc1d.avif?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=90 /></span>Each stage is packed with a wide array of unique enemies, each presenting their own challenges. Adapt your strategy and skills to defeat them all as you progress through the game. Get ready for intense battles against a diverse lineup of foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/d4ae4b5f98a0d295521ab109103337fd.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for epic showdowns against unique bosses at the end of each stage! Defeat these formidable foes to clear the path and dive deeper into the map, uncovering even greater challenges and treasures!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/ce65bea17bd202c7eb44ff80e3d77ee4.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling team-based roguelike game where strategy is key! Assemble your squad, prepare for intense battles, and unleash powerful combos to outsmart your foes. Each encounter challenges your tactics and adaptability, ensuring no two runs are ever the same. Gear up, strategize, and fight for survival in an ever-changing world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/ffc381f3b79a7f7dfaf8d8d473565727.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate party of four from a diverse cast of characters! Choose agile archers, powerful magicians, valiant swordsmen, and resourceful miners, each with unique abilities. Mix and match to discover powerful synergies and conquer every challenge. The adventure awaits\u2014who will join your quest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/179966dcc6eaa8a773321082eb4c5e57.avif?t=1745413899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/b3cf4dcf54b4ef8c41fc5ce2880dfece.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast array of maps filled with hidden treasures and formidable foes. Each area offers unique challenges and secrets waiting to be conquered. Venture deep into the unknown and uncover the mysteries that lie within the abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/249ab1f80f58ae25713476cbeaa222f0.avif?t=1745413899\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/e70d5c83a5cac6e4a4dc9cf3e1cbbc1d.avif?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=90 /></span>Each stage is packed with a wide array of unique enemies, each presenting their own challenges. Adapt your strategy and skills to defeat them all as you progress through the game. Get ready for intense battles against a diverse lineup of foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641170/extras/d4ae4b5f98a0d295521ab109103337fd.webp?t=1745413899\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for epic showdowns against unique bosses at the end of each stage! Defeat these formidable foes to clear the path and dive deeper into the map, uncovering even greater challenges and treasures!</p>",
